# scripts/build-ports writes the commit each launcher was built from here.
# Verifying the pin only proved the *source* was the reviewed commit; the
# binary that actually ran was whatever the checkout happened to contain, and
# bootstrap updates sources in place without touching build output. A launcher
# built before a repin therefore survived it, and a four-port PASS was once
# recorded against a shen-go binary older than its own pin.
BUILD_STAMP = Path(".urdr-build-stamp")

